WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:21.117
Good afternoon! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.118 --> 00:00:25.980
I'm called a white rhinoceros.

3
00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:31.259
But white rhinos are actually gray.

4
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.961
We're very big land mammals.

5
00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:38.693
Where do you live?

6
00:00:38.694 --> 00:00:44.358
Most white rhinos live in South Africa.

7
00:00:44.359 --> 00:00:48.464
We like grassy plains.

8
00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:51.913
Do you eat grasses?

9
00:00:51.914 --> 00:00:56.954
Yes. White rhinos eat grasses.

10
00:00:56.955 --> 00:01:04.177
Our mouths are very wide.

11
00:01:04.178 --> 00:01:10.668
So we can eat a lot at once!

12
00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:16.428
Why do you roll in mud?

13
00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:21.413
Mud protects us from the hot sun.

14
00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:25.644
And it keeps bugs away.

15
00:01:25.645 --> 00:01:33.122
I like your horns!

16
00:01:33.123 --> 00:01:38.079
White rhinos have two horns.

17
00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:42.625
We use them to fight.

18
00:01:42.626 --> 00:01:47.386
Oh! Do you have many enemies?

19
00:01:47.387 --> 00:01:52.723
White rhinos fight each other sometimes.

20
00:01:52.724 --> 00:01:57.219
But people are our main enemy.

21
00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.083
They hunt us for our horns.

22
00:02:01.084 --> 00:02:04.927
Do you ever run?

23
00:02:04.928 --> 00:02:10.541
Sometimes white rhinos run very fast.

24
00:02:10.542 --> 00:02:14.670
We charge at things!

25
00:02:14.671 --> 00:02:22.486
But we're too big to run for long.

26
00:02:22.487 --> 00:02:26.167
The sun feels hot.

27
00:02:26.168 --> 00:02:32.159
I'm going to rest in the shade now.

28
00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:39.008
Bye, Rhinoceros!
